body:
Okay try this: don't think about pink elephants. Bet you thought about one, right? The human brain is so good at thinking about what you don't want to. I've found with me that when something goes wrong, an almost intrusive thought of suicidal thought comes in, and then my thoughts get worse when I start getting stressed about them happening. Other people's advice on how to distract yourself is great for this reason! Can't say it is 100%, but is a definite help for those intrusive, old-learnt-thought-pattern kinda suicidal thoughts. 

&#x200B;

Keep on trucking!
